{
  "abstract": "Single and joint decay angular distributions in the reaction p p \u2192 \u0394 ++ \u0394 ++ at 9.13 GeV/ c are discussed in the framework of single and double statistical tensors. The t dependence of 12 double statistical tensors is presented. Cross sections for p p \u2192 p p \u03c0 + \u03c0 \u2212 and p p \u2192 \u0394 ++ \u0394 ++ are determined to be 2.60 \u00b1 0.10 and 0.90 \u00b1 0.10 mb respectively. The results obtained are compared with other experiments mainly at 5.7 and 12 GeV/ c .",
